// How long responses that can only ever be reused after revalidation (e.g.
// `no-cache` or `max-age=0` alongside a validator) are retained for. Their
// freshness lifetime is zero, so there is no lifetime to derive a revalidation
// buffer from - without a bounded window they'd be evicted immediately and
// could never be revalidated against.
